  <data key="d14">ai_assisted_reviewed_source_assertion</data>
  <data key="d16">20802</data>
  <data key="d17">2025-08-25</data>
  <data key="d18">In the financial sector, agents can be implemented in a few different ways – they can be added to existing workflows and infrastructure or built from scratch, requiring an overhaul of the ecosystem. Wherever they sit, they must align with internal InfoSec requirements and meet regulatory obligations like GDPR or CCPA to avoid risks.</data>
